OL,3,GNEWSAUS military aircraft leave second
OL,4,AUK base, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral US military aircraft have left
OL,7,Fa second airbase in Britain on Monday,
OL,8,Faccording to a report in the Wall
OL,9,FStreet Journal (WSJ).
OL,11,FTwo US refuelling tankers that were
OL,12,Fusing the RAF Mildenhall airbase in
OL,13,FSuffolk diverted to Germany earlier on
OL,14,FMonday, while several other tankers at
OL,15,Fthe base were moved bA to Germany and
OL,16,Fother locations later in the day, the
OL,17,FWSJ report said.
OL,19,FThis action was taken in response to a
OL,20,Fthreat from Iran, the newspaper
OL,21,Freported, citing US officials.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
